{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bKq4cYOYN81795132710.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國家主席習近平與美國總統特朗普昨日出席亞太經合組織(APEC)峰會期間，出現「伸出援手」的溫馨一幕。</p><p></p><p>中美元首昨日在深圳國際交流中心，在官員、工作人員及記者陪同下乘搭扶手電梯。習近平扶著特朗普的左臂，讓對方先走上電梯。當特朗普站穩後主動伸出左手，說「牽著我手」，之後習近平再扶著對方手臂，並排站立上樓，準備前往會場。多國傳媒亦轉載相關片段。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T01:23:53.387919+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T23:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T11:57:14.681107+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T01:17:15.790600+00:00","content_hash":"b166dfdb1e020a3ab78c28632c7ab2f4934d8a1a05fa77ee411aa0a9b9c97b5a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T01:23:53.387919+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}